    Name the LTI Dependabot group after the module (#8282)
    
    Grouped Dependabot pull requests are titled after the group name and do
    not mention the directory, so the generic name minor-and-patch hid that
    these updates are for the LTI module. Renaming the group to
    lti-minor-and-patch makes this visible in the pull request title.
    
    Example #8276 is not easily identifiable as an LTI patch:
    
        Bump the minor-and-patch group across 1 directory with 8 updates
    
    With this change, the title would become:
    
        Bump the lti-minor-and-patch group across 1 directory with 8 updates
    
